{"id":"76375","name":"韩式辣萝卜","author":"avon、","authorId":"1441801","desc":"","cover":"images/76375/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"1根"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白萝卜一根。","img":"images/76375/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净后切成方块。","img":"images/76375/step_2.png"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入适量盐腌制20分钟。","img":"images/76375/step_3.png"},{"step":4,"desc":"洋葱和小葱切好备用。","img":"images/76375/step_4.png"},{"step":5,"desc":"萝卜腌制20分钟后会出很多水，不用倒，直接把洋葱和小葱倒入萝卜内。","img":"images/76375/step_5.png"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入蒜米。","img":"images/76375/step_6.png"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入姜末。","img":"images/76375/step_7.png"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入适量鱼露。","img":"images/76375/step_8.png"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入多多的辣椒面。","img":"images/76375/step_9.png"},{"step":10,"desc":"把所有调料拌匀。","img":"images/76375/step_10.png"},{"step":11,"desc":"再撒几粒味精。","img":"images/76375/step_11.png"},{"step":12,"desc":"拌匀后再在上层撒一层辣椒面。","img":"images/76375/step_12.png"},{"step":13,"desc":"转移到保鲜盒内。","img":"images/76375/step_13.png"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入冰箱冷藏三天即可。","img":"images/76375/step_14.png"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}